    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/10bf0bb7c8fd43a3bea8a4be0947ad6f.webp?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/689d6bf2b522f41c8837da5fe9a9c8d7.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/689d6bf2b522f41c8837da5fe9a9c8d7.webm?t=1754322842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Welcome to Block Factory, a serene and satisfying building experience. Design thoughtful workflows to craft adorable 3D figurines, made from simple building blocks, and bring them to life with care and attention.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.webp?t=1754322842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=30 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/59a48fd55a29d47d763c5a00382ed014.webp?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/eb53631ebb3136572ae7f22664f68e7e.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/eb53631ebb3136572ae7f22664f68e7e.webm?t=1754322842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Design your factory as a relaxing creative space. Stack, shape, cut, paint, glue,... and assemble with care using specialized machines, each step unfolding like a quiet melody. Watch your creations evolve piece by piece as you unlock new technologies.<br>There\u2019s no rush, refine at your own pace and enjoy the process as your ideas come to life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.webp?t=1754322842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=30 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/171d014a7d37c979506498027a66f65b.webp?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/f439ddc381ef13dfbadc4184901294b8.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" width=600 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/f439ddc381ef13dfbadc4184901294b8.webm?t=1754322842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Create your own 3D figurines block by block, then build a relaxing production flow to bring them to life. Once complete, share your creations with friends and the world, creativity has no limits here.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.webp?t=1754322842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=30 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/bd1fe99f1fd679e9eada389b7f1cc3fb.webp?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=46 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A relaxing creative experience<br></li><li>Build and refine flowing production lines without pressure<br></li><li>Charming 3D figurines made from modular building blocks<br></li><li>Evolving miniature displays that showcase your progress<br></li><li>Flexible play modes that support every style, from light design to deep creativity</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/10bf0bb7c8fd43a3bea8a4be0947ad6f.webp?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/689d6bf2b522f41c8837da5fe9a9c8d7.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/689d6bf2b522f41c8837da5fe9a9c8d7.webm?t=1754322842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Welcome to Block Factory, a serene and satisfying building experience. Design thoughtful workflows to craft adorable 3D figurines, made from simple building blocks, and bring them to life with care and attention.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.webp?t=1754322842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=30 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/59a48fd55a29d47d763c5a00382ed014.webp?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/eb53631ebb3136572ae7f22664f68e7e.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/eb53631ebb3136572ae7f22664f68e7e.webm?t=1754322842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Design your factory as a relaxing creative space. Stack, shape, cut, paint, glue,... and assemble with care using specialized machines, each step unfolding like a quiet melody. Watch your creations evolve piece by piece as you unlock new technologies.<br>There\u2019s no rush, refine at your own pace and enjoy the process as your ideas come to life.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.webp?t=1754322842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=30 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/171d014a7d37c979506498027a66f65b.webp?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=46 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/f439ddc381ef13dfbadc4184901294b8.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" width=600 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/f439ddc381ef13dfbadc4184901294b8.webm?t=1754322842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Create your own 3D figurines block by block, then build a relaxing production flow to bring them to life. Once complete, share your creations with friends and the world, creativity has no limits here.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.poster.avif?t=1754322842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/6aaa5c509583fbdfe193bf81c465441b.webp?t=1754322842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=614 height=30 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827680/extras/bd1fe99f1fd679e9eada389b7f1cc3fb.webp?t=1754322842\" width=614 height=46 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A relaxing creative experience<br></li><li>Build and refine flowing production lines without pressure<br></li><li>Charming 3D figurines made from modular building blocks<br></li><li>Evolving miniature displays that showcase your progress<br></li><li>Flexible play modes that support every style, from light design to deep creativity</li></ul>",
